<div class="pet-workstation container" aria-label="小江的纸边工位"><div class="pet-station-copy"><span>COMPANION / 纸边工位</span><p>读到这里，歇一会儿。</p><small>小江在这里陪你。点开小菜单，或把她拖到喜欢的位置。</small></div>
<aside id="blog-pet" class="blog-pet is-flow" data-motion="idle" data-pose="0" aria-label="博客小伙伴：小江">
  <div class="pet-stage">
    <p id="pet-message" class="pet-bubble" role="status" hidden></p>
    <button class="pet-avatar" type="button" aria-label="和小江打招呼；可拎起拖动或用方向键移动" aria-describedby="pet-help">
      <span class="pet-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <img class="pet-art" src="/img/pet/field-notes/idle.webp" width="320" height="320" alt="" draggable="false" decoding="async">
        <span class="pet-sprite" hidden></span>
        <span class="pet-sprite pet-previous" hidden></span>
      </span>
      <span class="pet-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
      <span class="pet-sleep" aria-hidden="true">z Z z</span>
      <span class="pet-hit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="pet-toolbar"><span class="pet-caption"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>小江</span><button class="pet-menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="小江的小菜单" aria-controls="pet-menu" aria-expanded="false" title="小菜单">⋯</button><button class="pet-hide" type="button" aria-label="收起小江" title="收起">−</button></div>
    <div id="pet-menu" class="pet-menu" role="group" aria-label="小江的小菜单" hidden>
      <span class="pet-menu-heading">小江陪你读</span>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="jump">✦ 蹦一下</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="read">▤ 翻翻笔记</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="stretch">⌁ 伸个懒腰</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="nap">☾ 打个盹</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="stroll">→ 走两步</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="cheer">♡ 夸我一句</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="reset">↘ 回到不挡字的位置</button>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="top">↑ 回到顶部</button>
      <a href="/archives/#search">⌕ 找文章</a>
      <button type="button" data-pet-action="quiet" aria-pressed="false">安静陪伴</button>
    </div>
    <p id="pet-help" class="pet-help">小江是银发猫耳、戴耳机的工程手记小助手。点击挥手打招呼，双击蹦跳，连点几次她会有意见；右键也能开菜单；拖动时拎起衣领，快速甩出会飞起来落地；她也会自己走两步；菜单可让她翻笔记、伸懒腰或坐下打盹；点击后先起身再回应；手机上竖向滑动是翻页，横向拖动才会移动她；方向键移动，Shift 加方向键加速；Enter 或空格打招呼；Escape 关闭气泡和小菜单。</p>
  </div>
  <button class="pet-restore" type="button" aria-label="叫回小江" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span>小江</button>
</aside>
</div>
